claim.claim-text:
(a) the immunodominant antigen to human T cells is M;
(b) the combination of immunodominant antigens to human T cells are M and HN; or
(c) the combination of immunodominant antigens to human T cells are M, HN, and N.

(a) the immunodominant antigen to human T cells is F;
(b) the combination of immunodominant antigens to human T cells are F and N;
(c) the combination of immunodominant antigens to human T cells are F, N, and M2-1; or
(d) the combination of immunodominant antigens to human T cells is F, N, M2-1, and M.
